# Daily research findings are committed on purpose. They are the evidence trail
# behind every taste layer change, and the weekly summarizer needs a week of them
# in one place — CI runners are destroyed after each job, so anything not
# committed does not survive to Sunday.
#
# The weekly artifacts derived from them are not committed. They are regenerated
# on every run, and the reasoning worth keeping ends up in the pull request body.
research/cache/summary-*.json
research/cache/proposal-*.json
research/cache/proposal-*.md
research/cache/*.tmp

node_modules/
dist/
.env
